  foundation=["You can work with AWS through the web console, the command line (AWS CLI), software development kits (SDKs) in your code, or templates that describe infrastructure (AWS CloudFormation).",
              "Use the console for one-off tasks and learning; use scripts and templates for anything you repeat.", "Deployment models: all-in cloud, hybrid (cloud plus on-premises, for example with AWS Outposts or Direct Connect) and on-premises."],
